{"id":"rcpfajgyyaguo1smla5qfwc2q","title":"空气孔将硅片转化为紫外聚焦平面镜","originalTitle":"Air holes turn silicon wafers into flat ultraviolet focusing mirrors for compact optics","summary":"研究人员开发了一种新型平面光学器件，通过在硅片上蚀刻空气腔体，实现了紫外光的聚焦。该器件利用硅的强吸收特性，将光限制在空气腔体内，从而避免了光的损失。实验结果显示，该器件能够在325纳米紫外光下聚焦，并且具有紧凑的光学系统潜力，可用于高分辨率成像、光谱学和传感。相关研究成果发表在《先进光子学》期刊上。","reason":null,"source":{"name":"Phys.org"},"links":{"original":"https://phys.org/news/2026-11-air-holes-silicon-wafers-flat.html"},"publishedAt":"2026-11-06T22:00:01.000Z","discoveredAt":"2026-11-07T12:11:46.349Z","timelineAt":"2026-11-07T12:11:46.349Z","category":"materials-energy","tags":["论文发表","Nature"],"score":36,"selected":false,"channel":"news","story":{"publicId":"cbeb9d1c-3590-4888-9432-8d6f0ee928c5","title":"硅基超紫外反射光子元表面研究发表"},"x":null,"readingMode":"full","author":null,"body":null,"outline":[],"relatedStories":[{"publicId":"cbeb9d1c-3590-4888-9432-8d6f0ee928c5","title":"硅基超紫外反射光子元表面研究发表"}],"topics":[{"slug":"nature","name":"Nature"},{"slug":"conference-paper","name":"顶会与论文接收"}],"indexable":false,"markdownAvailable":true,"group":{"factId":"fQ897h3PDe5U","reportCount":1,"additionalSourceCount":0},"hasTranslation":false,"bodyLanguage":"original"}